	(text "【LAYOUT】跨阻输入节点面积最小；Rf 紧靠反相输入，输入走线加保护环并保持助焊剂清洗干净\nOPA333：避免热电偶效应（Avoid temperature gradients that create thermoelectric (Seebeck) effects）\n        ——远离热源、避免异种金属结点、防止气流直吹\nADS1110：差分输入成对走线、远离 SW 节点与电感；VDD 的 100nF 就近回地"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.696 65.532 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "39337370-83e6-431e-93b7-bd666e8be58b")
	)
	(text "【参数计算 — 跨阻前端与 ADC】\nV_OUT = I_ph × Rf = I_ph × 47k（BPW34 灵敏度典型 0.6 A/W）\n例：10 µA → 0.47 V；50 µA → 2.35 V（ADS1110 满量程 ±2.048 V @PGA=1）\n带宽 f_p = 1/(2π·Rf·Cf) = 1/(2π×47k×10p) = 339 kHz（Cf 兼作相位补偿）\n噪声：√(4kTRf) = 28 nV/√Hz，折合总噪声 ≈ 20 µV rms（约 0.3 LSB）\nADC 分辨率：LSB = 4.096/65536 = 62.5 µV ⇒ 电流分辨率 62.5µ/47k = 1.33 nA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.696 84.328 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7007a8c1-cd06-48ee-bef8-dc3f5bf606b8")
	)
